FreeType 2.14.3, https://github.com/freetype/freetype/tree/VER-2-14-3
Copyright The FreeType Project. Used under the FreeType License (docs/FTL.TXT).
Selected scalable outline drivers, rasterizers, SFNT/WOFF/WOFF2 support.
Sources are unmodified. flux_ft*.h configure the freestanding port, memory-only
streams, GCC nonlocal jumps, and an adapter for the upstream i386 helper typo.
WOFF2 uses the separately attributed Brotli decoder. SVG fonts are disabled.
